# What EAS Build does NOT need uploaded.
#
# IMPORTANT: when this file exists, EAS uses it *instead of* `.gitignore` to
# decide what goes into the build archive. So everything `.gitignore` excludes
# has to be repeated here — otherwise `node_modules/` and, worse, a stale
# locally-prebuilt `android/` would be uploaded and used.
#
# Added after the M15 build uploaded 219 MB, of which ~94 MB was reference
# material and documentation that no `require()` reaches and no APK contains.
#
# Kept deliberately short. Every extra pattern is a chance to exclude something
# the build needs, and the two directories below are the whole of the problem.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mirrors .gitignore. Keep in sync.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
dist-verify/
dist-verify-android/

# Generated by prebuild. EAS runs its own prebuild from app.json; uploading a
# local one would make the build use whatever identity was last generated here
# — which is how a stale launcher label shipped at M13.
android/
ios/

npm-debug.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.orig.*
web-build/
*.log
*.app
*.tar.gz
*.ipa
*.apk
*.aab
.DS_Store
yarn.lock
package-lock.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tracked in git, but the app does not build from them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Source renders, generation prompts and per-image provenance READMEs — 83 MB.
# The *shipped* art is in assets/art/, which is deliberately not excluded.
design-reference/

# Specs, decisions, gates and screenshot evidence — 11 MB.
docs/
